+
+## App SDK contracts
+
+PlantGuide publishes machine-readable contracts for its tag-identification and care-card payloads:
+
+- `schemas/identify-response.schema.json` — output of `identify_from_tags()` / `identify_from_sample()`.
+- `schemas/care-response.schema.json` — output of `care_card_for_species()`.
+- `sdk/typescript/index.ts` — TypeScript request/response interfaces for app integrations.
+
+The schemas use JSON Schema Draft 2020-12. Consumers should treat optional sample/image fields as additive and validate the core `query_tags`, `matches`, `model`, and care-card fields. The TypeScript contracts mirror nullable catalog identity fields emitted by the Python code.
+
